# Feature gate (before implementation)

Before building a **new** Capital feature, evaluate it with `docs/FEATURE_GATE.md` / `src/design/featureGate.ts`.

Score **0–5** on value (fantasy, loop, decisions, systems, emergence, mastery, expression, replay, social, stories) and costs (cognitive, UI, tech, balance, maintenance, content). Compare **VALUE SCORE** vs **COST SCORE**.

**Reject** when:

- Main justification is “other games have this”
- VALUE &lt; COST
- Freeze broken (main-quest width / fake MP / foreign merge)

**Prefer** features that improve **several existing systems** at once.

Do not start implementation on `reject` or `park` without an explicit human override recorded in the PR.
